@startuml
title SPU Execution Sequence - Step Processing Unit Invocation
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam roundcorner 0

participant "Step Composition" as SC
participant "Step Processing Unit (SPU)" as SPU
participant "SPUExecutionResult[TOutput]" as SER

SC -> SPU : execute(input: TInput)
SPU --> SER : construct SPUExecutionResult
processingArtifact
spuErrorOccurrences
validatorResult
TErrorOccurrenceContext
SER --> SPU : return result
SPU --> SC : SPUExecutionResult[TOutput]

note right of SC : Step Composition selects SPU,
supplies input, consumes result
SPU does NOT assemble StepExecutionResult
SPU does NOT decide Step flow

@enduml